{
    "title": "Learn Coding/Programming: Mimo",
    "description": "<b>Learn to code in Python, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, TypeScript, SQL, and more in the Mimo coding app, designed to fit programming into your busy schedule.</b> Supercharge your programming skills, become a Python, HTML, JavaScript, or backend developer, and kickstart your career in Tech in minutes a day. \r\n\r\nOur bite-sized lessons are perfect for quick learning sessions that help you progress in learning to code every day. Whether new to coding or refining your skills in HTML, Python, JavaScript, Express, Node.js, React, or other programming languages, <b>Mimo Learn to Code's intuitive interface and encouraging approach make it one of the best choices for beginners but also caters to more advanced learners. \r\n\r\nCareer paths and more complex projects guide you toward specific job roles in the tech industry. With Mimo's career paths, you get structured learning of Python, HTML, JavaScript, and other programming languages through full-stack, front-end, Python AI, and backend web development paths.\r\n\r\n</b> Learn coding, apply what you've learned in practical scenarios, and build a portfolio. Run code in Python, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML, SQL, and more on the go. \r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Google Play's Editor's Choice\r\n\ud83c\udfc5 Best Self-Improvement Apps of 2018\r\n\r\nLearn coding and programming in SQL, HTML, CSS, Python, Express, Node.JS, React, and JavaScript code, or choose career paths: Full-stack, Python AI Developer, Back-End Developer, or Front-end, and progress fast in learning programming! You can start coding, kickstart your Tech career, and land your dream job quickly.\r\n\r\n<b>With the Mimo Learn Coding/Programming app, you'll be able to:</b>\r\n\r\n- Advance your career with Full-Stack, Front-End Development, Back-End web development, and Python AI Developer Path.\r\n\u2022 Master coding skills by learning Python, HTML, and JavaScript, building projects, and practicing programming. Gain TypeScript, HTML, CSS, SQL, JavaScript, Python, Express, Node.JS, or React expertise to improve your technical proficiency and start to code on your own.\r\n\u2022 Go through a structured curriculum that guides you through the code learning.\r\n\u2022 Solve bite-size coding challenges for efficient and focused code learning.\r\n\u2022 Run code in Python, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML, and SQL and build real-world projects on the go with our mobile IDE/code editor.\r\n\u2022 Test your Python, HTML, or JavaScript knowledge in interactive coding and programming playgrounds.\r\n\u2022 Learn programming and develop your coding skills with guided projects that provide real-world experience.\r\n\u2022 Get certification in programming to enhance your professional portfolio and share your achievements on platforms such as LinkedIn.\r\n\r\n<b>Mimo: Learn Coding app's testimonials</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022  \"I've tried quite a few coding platforms for backend and frontend, but none matched the ease of learning I experienced with Mimo.\" - Sam Phelan.\r\n\u2022  \"The coding skills acquired through Mimo's courses made me feel more confident about my ability to code and create software.\" - Cl\u00e9ment Durandeau.\r\n\r\nThe Mimo coding app is an effective way to code in Python, JavaScript, HTML, TypeScript, SQL, Express, Node.JS, React, and CSS. Get our code-learning app, explore our free programming courses, build websites and apps through hands-on coding, and create your project portfolio. Learn coding and programming in popular programming languages like Python, JavaScript, or HTML from your phone. \r\n\r\n- \"This way, you can work learning to code into your daily routine whenever you have a few minutes of downtime.\" \u2013 TechCrunch\r\n\u2022 \"The app's lessons are bite-size to make it easy to squeeze coding into your busy day.\" \u2013 The New York Times\r\n\r\nStart your Tech career with the Mimo app! Develop coding skills in Python, JavaScript, HTML, TypeScript, CSS, and SQL to unlock new opportunities with the Mimo Learn to Code app. Learn to code in Python, JavaScript, HTML, and any language you like in the #1 coding app, all at your own pace, and show your programming skills to the world. You can code, too!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Learn to code in Python, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, TypeScript, SQL, and more in the Mimo coding app, designed to fit programming into your busy schedule.</b> Supercharge your programming skills, become a Python, HTML, JavaScript, or backend developer, and kickstart your career in Tech in minutes a day. <br><br>Our bite-sized lessons are perfect for quick learning sessions that help you progress in learning to code every day. Whether new to coding or refining your skills in HTML, Python, JavaScript, Express, Node.js, React, or other programming languages, <b>Mimo Learn to Code&#39;s intuitive interface and encouraging approach make it one of the best choices for beginners but also caters to more advanced learners. <br><br>Career paths and more complex projects guide you toward specific job roles in the tech industry. With Mimo&#39;s career paths, you get structured learning of Python, HTML, JavaScript, and other programming languages through full-stack, front-end, Python AI, and backend web development paths.<br><br></b> Learn coding, apply what you&#39;ve learned in practical scenarios, and build a portfolio. Run code in Python, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML, SQL, and more on the go. <br>\ud83c\udfc6 Google Play&#39;s Editor&#39;s Choice<br>\ud83c\udfc5 Best Self-Improvement Apps of 2018<br><br>Learn coding and programming in SQL, HTML, CSS, Python, Express, Node.JS, React, and JavaScript code, or choose career paths: Full-stack, Python AI Developer, Back-End Developer, or Front-end, and progress fast in learning programming! You can start coding, kickstart your Tech career, and land your dream job quickly.<br><br><b>With the Mimo Learn Coding/Programming app, you&#39;ll be able to:</b><br><br>- Advance your career with Full-Stack, Front-End Development, Back-End web development, and Python AI Developer Path.<br>\u2022 Master coding skills by learning Python, HTML, and JavaScript, building projects, and practicing programming. Gain TypeScript, HTML, CSS, SQL, JavaScript, Python, Express, Node.JS, or React expertise to improve your technical proficiency and start to code on your own.<br>\u2022 Go through a structured curriculum that guides you through the code learning.<br>\u2022 Solve bite-size coding challenges for efficient and focused code learning.<br>\u2022 Run code in Python, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML, and SQL and build real-world projects on the go with our mobile IDE/code editor.<br>\u2022 Test your Python, HTML, or JavaScript knowledge in interactive coding and programming playgrounds.<br>\u2022 Learn programming and develop your coding skills with guided projects that provide real-world experience.<br>\u2022 Get certification in programming to enhance your professional portfolio and share your achievements on platforms such as LinkedIn.<br><br><b>Mimo: Learn Coding app&#39;s testimonials</b><br><br>\u2022  &quot;I&#39;ve tried quite a few coding platforms for backend and frontend, but none matched the ease of learning I experienced with Mimo.&quot; - Sam Phelan.<br>\u2022  &quot;The coding skills acquired through Mimo&#39;s courses made me feel more confident about my ability to code and create software.&quot; - Cl\u00e9ment Durandeau.<br><br>The Mimo coding app is an effective way to code in Python, JavaScript, HTML, TypeScript, SQL, Express, Node.JS, React, and CSS. Get our code-learning app, explore our free programming courses, build websites and apps through hands-on coding, and create your project portfolio. Learn coding and programming in popular programming languages like Python, JavaScript, or HTML from your phone. <br><br>- &quot;This way, you can work learning to code into your daily routine whenever you have a few minutes of downtime.&quot; \u2013 TechCrunch<br>\u2022 &quot;The app&#39;s lessons are bite-size to make it easy to squeeze coding into your busy day.&quot; \u2013 The New York Times<br><br>Start your Tech career with the Mimo app! Develop coding skills in Python, JavaScript, HTML, TypeScript, CSS, and SQL to unlock new opportunities with the Mimo Learn to Code app. Learn to code in Python, JavaScript, HTML, and any language you like in the #1 coding app, all at your own pace, and show your programming skills to the world. You can code, too!",
